# Loxodon Eavesdropper's "Whenever you draw your second card each turn" (CR 121.1, 603.2): on turn 1 (no draw step) Bot1 casts it, then Ancestral
# Recall: its first card is Bot1's first this turn, its second is the second - one trigger, a 4/4 with vigilance - and its third gives nothing more.
# On turn 2 Bot2 draws its own second card with Ancestral Recall off a Mox Sapphire: only Bot1's draws count for Bot1's Eavesdropper, which is not
# pumped again. On turn 3 Bot1's single draw-step card gives nothing: a 3/3 with no vigilance that is tapped by attacking.

